### 1. Get Basket
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/basket
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 2. Add Item to Basket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/basket/items
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "some-uuid",
  "quantity": 1
}

### 3. Clear Basket
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/basket
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
